---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro'; import {projects} from '../../data/content';
---
<Base title="Projects"><section class="hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Projects</span><h1>Selected traffic, road safety and mobility experience.</h1><p>Representative assignments supported by the current ATRS project source material.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="grid">{projects.map(p=><article class="card"><div class="meta"><span>{p.country}</span><span>·</span><span>{p.date}</span></div><span class="pill">{p.category}</span><h2 style="font-size:1.55rem">{p.title}</h2><p><strong>{p.client}</strong></p><p>{p.summary}</p><a class="link" href={'/projects/'+p.slug+'/'}>Read case study →</a></article>)}</div><div class="pending"><strong>Content gate:</strong> the website documentation specifies eight case studies. The current source set provides five project records; the remaining three should be supplied and verified before publication.</div></div></section></Base>